---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page title="About Nairon — AI employees for property management operators" description="Nairon builds, runs, and manages AI employees that do real operational work inside the tools property management businesses already use — leasing teams, maintenance &amp; dispatch, and rent &amp; renewals." eyebrow="About" heading="We put AI to work — inside the businesses that run the real world." intro="Nairon builds, runs, and manages AI employees that do real operational work. They handle leasing inquiries, work-order dispatch, rent, and renewals inside the systems your team already uses.">
  <div class="page-body">
    <section class="page-section">
      <h2 class="page-section-title">What we do</h2>
      <p class="page-section-sub">Real operational work, done inside your existing tools.</p>
      <p>Most operators do not need another app to configure and maintain. They need work to get done. Nairon delivers AI employees that pick up the tasks your team runs every day — answering leasing inquiries, dispatching vendors, chasing rent, and following up on renewals.</p>
      <p>These AI employees work inside the tools you already run: your CRM, your scheduling system, your inbox. There is no rip-and-replace migration and no new platform for your staff to learn. Access is scoped and audited, so an AI employee only touches what it is meant to touch.</p>
      <p>We manage the whole thing as a service. You are not buying software to run yourself. You are hiring a workforce that we build, operate, and improve on your behalf.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section">
      <h2 class="page-section-title">The model</h2>
      <p class="page-section-sub">Built on 30+ successful AI projects and delivered in four steps.</p>
      <p>We did not start from a template. Our delivery model comes from more than 30 AI projects that shipped and produced measurable results. Every engagement follows the same four steps.</p>
      <div class="page-grid cols-2">
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">01</div>
          <h3>Discover</h3>
          <p>We map how your operation actually runs, find the tasks worth automating, and agree on the outcomes we will measure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">02</div>
          <h3>Build</h3>
          <p>We build AI employees that work inside your existing tools, with scoped and audited access to your CRM, scheduling, and inbox.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">03</div>
          <h3>Tune</h3>
          <p>We test against real work, correct the edge cases, and refine each AI employee until its output matches how your team does the job.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">04</div>
          <h3>Enable</h3>
          <p>We put the AI employees to work, keep them running, and report on the outcomes so you can see the impact.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section">
      <h2 class="page-section-title">Who we serve</h2>
      <p class="page-section-sub">Property management operators who run real, physical work.</p>
      <div class="page-grid cols-3">
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">LEASING</div>
          <h3>Leasing</h3>
          <p>Inquiries answered around the clock, applicant pre-qualification, and tours booked — handled inside your CRM and listings.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">MAINTENANCE</div>
          <h3>Maintenance &amp; dispatch</h3>
          <p>Work-order triage, vendor dispatch, and job tracking — chased until the ticket is closed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">RENT</div>
          <h3>Rent &amp; renewals</h3>
          <p>Overdue rent, renewal offers, and delinquency follow-up — routed and resolved without adding headcount.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section">
      <h2 class="page-section-title">Why it works</h2>
      <p class="page-section-sub">A managed workforce, not another tool to run.</p>
      <div class="page-grid cols-3">
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">MANAGED</div>
          <h3>We own the work</h3>
          <p>You hire an outcome, not a subscription. We build, run, and improve every AI employee so your team does not have to.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">IN PLACE</div>
          <h3>No migrations</h3>
          <p>AI employees work inside your current tools. Nothing gets ripped out, and your staff learns no new platform.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="page-card">
          <div class="page-card-kicker">ACCOUNTABLE</div>
          <h3>Scoped and measured</h3>
          <p>Access is scoped and audited. Outcomes are measurable, so you can see exactly what the work is producing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section">
      <h2 class="page-section-title">Where to start</h2>
      <p class="page-section-sub">Nairon is based in Miami. Reach us at hello@naironai.com or book a short audit of your operation.</p>
      <p>An AI audit maps the tasks in your business worth handing to an AI employee and the outcomes we would target. It is the fastest way to see where this fits.</p>
      <a href="/#book" style="align-items:center; background-color:#0f6bd4; border-radius:40px; color:#fff; display:inline-flex; font-family:'Geist',system-ui,sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:500; gap:8px; margin-top:8px; padding:13px 24px; text-decoration:none;">Book an AI audit <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </section>
  </div>
</Page>
